liblo: liblo (lightweight OSC implementation)
liblo:
liblo: liblo is an implementation of the OSC protocol for POSIX systems. 
liblo: Open Sound Control (OSC) is a protocol for communication among
liblo: computers, sound synthesizers, and other multimedia devices that is
liblo: optimized for modern networking technology.
liblo: OSC's advantages include interoperability, accuracy, flexibility,
liblo: and provides everything needed for real-time control of sound and
liblo: other media processing.
